Addendum - simplified fork (2026)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository is a modified, simplified version of changedetection.io, made by
AdityaSingh910 for an academic (final-year engineering) project. It is based on
upstream commit c74be04 (version 0.70.4, tagged upstream-baseline-c74be04 here).

Optional features were removed (LLM/AI integrations, MCP server, screenshot
comparison, PWA, RSS output feeds, proxy checker, Selenium and Puppeteer
fetchers, example plugins, non-English translations, Docker/CI files). Modified
files carry a notice at the top; CHANGES.md lists every change. The text above
this addendum is the upstream NOTICE, unchanged.

The modifications are also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The changedetection.io name and logo remain the upstream project's brand assets
(see above) and are not licensed by this fork either.

Dependencies added by this fork:
  playwright - Apache-2.0
  pillow     - MIT-CMU (HPND)
